          "finding_details": "Raw running config SHA-256: 8ed0c9e3e59ab6fc8afc4e5e20d238df8b4935a3640646cb62cedeb5ef3f3654\nOfficial Cisco benchmark SHA-256: cea38d4f4c305fd029377fd56916560a0ef73afcdeed347bb17ace704928281c\nRunning config alone does not verify this control's complete operational check; manual review required.",
          "fix_text": "Configure the ASA to send log messages to the syslog servers as shown in the example below.\n\nASA(config)# logging host NDM_INTERFACE 10.1.48.10 6/1514\nASA(config)# logging host NDM_INTERFACE 10.1.48.11 6/1514\nASA(config)# logging trap notifications \nASA(config)# end",
